01:03:32,556 --> 01:03:35,956
うざいくらい貪欲に ハート地獄からかっぱらっちまえ
Greedily to the point of annoyance, steal your heart back from hell.

913
01:03:35,956 --> 01:03:38,756
loop輪廻じゃない routeは無限に
Not a loop of reincarnation, the route is infinite.

914
01:03:38,756 --> 01:03:42,556
ありふれた道じゃない 茨の道を好む玄人
Not a common path, an expert who prefers the path of thorns.

915
01:03:45,256 --> 01:03:49,256
盛大にもう 笑えばいいさ
Just laugh grandly now.

916
01:03:49,756 --> 01:03:52,956
才能煩悩のグラデーション
A gradation of talent and worldly desires,

917
01:03:52,956 --> 01:03:56,556
どうせならぐちゃぐちゃにしてよ
if you're going to do it, mess it all up.

918
01:03:56,556 --> 01:03:59,956
始めたのならやり切る覚悟を
If you've started, have the determination to finish it.

919
01:03:59,956 --> 01:04:03,756
敗者と勝者のduet
Duet of the loser and the winner.

920
01:04:03,756 --> 01:04:08,556
劣等感 弾き出された不条理の屑
Inferiority complex, trash of absurdity that's been ejected,

921
01:04:08,756 --> 01:04:11,756
振り払え貪欲に
greedily shake it off.

922
01:04:11,756 --> 01:04:17,256
志は消えない 2人ならやれるさ
Our ambition won't vanish, if we're together, we can do it.

923
01:04:19,256 --> 01:04:22,256
生きるってなんだ サボった者勝ちか
What is living? Is it better to just slack off?

924
01:04:22,256 --> 01:04:25,556
そんなもの握りつぶせ
Crush that idea.

925
01:04:25,556 --> 01:04:27,756
上辺じゃいられない
We can't stay on the surface,

926
01:04:27,756 --> 01:04:30,256
エンタメライダー
entertainment rider.

927
01:04:30,256 --> 01:04:33,556
人生賭け駆け抜け 絶望も栄光も lemme see you fight back
Bet your life and run through it, despair and glory, lemme see you fight back.

928
01:04:33,756 --> 01:04:36,956
どうなったって何も変わらないんだって
No matter what happens, nothing changes,

929
01:04:36,956 --> 01:04:39,956
ミームされた現実にとらわれて
trapped in a memed reality.

930
01:04:39,956 --> 01:04:43,756
this life where we're stuck taking chances

931
01:04:43,756 --> 01:04:46,756
飽き飽きしてんでしょ？
are you sick of it?

932
01:04:46,756 --> 01:04:49,556
we're living in a world with no direction

933
01:04:49,556 --> 01:04:51,956
reach out with our light 'til we make a connection

934
01:04:51,956 --> 01:04:53,756
tearing the walls apart

935
01:04:53,756 --> 01:04:56,756
facing it all, side by side

936
01:04:56,756 --> 01:05:00,756
once again, it's us against the world

937
01:05:00,477 --> 01:05:01,777
舐めんじゃねーよ
Don't underestimate me

938
01:05:01,777 --> 01:05:03,677
本能をヒリつかせて
Let your instincts burn

939
01:05:03,677 --> 01:05:05,877
本物見せつけろ
Show us your true worth

940
01:05:05,877 --> 01:05:08,277
圧倒絶頂
Overwhelming, pinnacle

941
01:05:08,277 --> 01:05:14,777
アンバランスを踊れ
Dance in the imbalance

942
01:05:14,777 --> 01:05:15,977
踊れ
Dance

943
01:05:17,777 --> 01:05:19,677
踊れ
Dance

944
01:05:21,277 --> 01:05:25,977
アンバランス...
Imbalance...

945
01:05:29,677 --> 01:05:32,477
Thanks for watching, everybody! Thank you to my guests!

946
01:05:32,477 --> 01:05:34,277
Thank you to the band! Thank you, everyone!

947
01:05:34,277 --> 01:05:36,277
Come hang out at Member's Afterparty!

948
01:05:36,277 --> 01:05:37,777
OK! あなたもよろしく！
OK! Best regards to you, too!

949
01:05:37,777 --> 01:05:39,277
Yeah, and buy the goods!

950
01:05:39,277 --> 01:05:42,477
That's about all! You guys, I'm Mori Calliope! Peace out, see ya!

951
01:05:46,477 --> 01:05:49,477
Woo! Let's go! Yeah! Bye!

952
01:05:52,977 --> 01:05:56,477
Yeah, what's up, you crazy skeletons?

953
01:05:58,277 --> 01:06:01,277
I mean... Dearest Dead Beats,

954
01:06:01,277 --> 01:06:03,677
the hour is finally upon us.

955
01:06:03,677 --> 01:06:07,977
The sale of Mori Calliope's birthday celebration goods is about to begin.

956
01:06:07,977 --> 01:06:12,277
On this most auspicious day, you've been granted a great blessing by Death herself.

957
01:06:12,277 --> 01:06:15,477
A most fortunate occurrence for thee,

958
01:06:15,477 --> 01:06:18,277
that such a glorious chest should appear before thine eyes.

959
01:06:18,277 --> 01:06:22,277
Let's take a peek at what the Goddess of Death herself has to offer, shall we?

960
01:06:22,277 --> 01:06:24,677
The journey ahead is long and arduous.

961
01:06:24,677 --> 01:06:28,677
It would do thee good to prepare for it with such luxurious treasures.

962
01:06:29,677 --> 01:06:33,477
Firstly, wouldst thou find comfort in dear Death's embrace?

963
01:06:33,477 --> 01:06:35,677
If it be so, take some warmth along thy journey

964
01:06:35,677 --> 01:06:41,277
with this very large, rollable blanket featuring a most intimidating and battle-ready maiden, yours truly,

965
01:06:41,277 --> 01:06:44,677
designed by my favorite dark fantasy artist, Shimhaq!

966
01:06:45,477 --> 01:06:49,277
The maiden in question possesses artwork in mass from this particular individual,

967
01:06:49,277 --> 01:06:52,477
so I'd be most elated if you bought it for yourself.

968
01:06:52,477 --> 01:06:53,777
Lay it across your bed,

969
01:06:53,777 --> 01:06:55,277
hang it on your wall,

970
01:06:55,277 --> 01:06:56,477
take it with you on an outing,

971
01:06:56,477 --> 01:06:58,277
think of the possibilities!

972
01:07:00,477 --> 01:07:02,977
Secondly, whilst on thy noble journey,

973
01:07:02,977 --> 01:07:05,977
thou mayest come to need a spark of aid.

974
01:07:05,977 --> 01:07:08,277
If it be so, take one of these amulets:

975
01:07:08,277 --> 01:07:10,477
The emblem of a knight to boost your strength,

976
01:07:10,477 --> 01:07:13,677
the emblem of a samurai to grant you additional dexterity,

977
01:07:13,677 --> 01:07:17,977
the emblem of a priestess to bestow additional health to thy weary body,

978
01:07:17,977 --> 01:07:22,977
and lastly, the emblem of a necromancer to grant thee additional intelligence.

979
01:07:22,977 --> 01:07:27,977
Alas, as Fortune be a fickle mistress, thou mayest only receive one in a set.

980
01:07:27,977 --> 01:07:31,277
I pray thee be granted the boon most favorable to thy quest.

981
01:07:31,277 --> 01:07:36,977
Or you could just purchase them all separately if you're looking to speedrun the experience, I suppose.

982
01:07:37,277 --> 01:07:41,977
Thirdly, I present to thee the shining centerpiece of this valuable collection.

983
01:07:41,977 --> 01:07:44,977
Take a moment of repose and sit beside this warm

984
01:07:44,977 --> 01:07:49,277
and healing light, granted unto thee by Death herself:

985
01:07:49,277 --> 01:07:51,977
A lantern to revive thee as many times as needed

986
01:07:51,977 --> 01:07:55,677
throughout even the most daunting of journeys.

987
01:07:55,677 --> 01:07:57,977
May it light thy way to victory,

988
01:07:57,977 --> 01:08:00,277
or to sweet dreams, whichever is preferred.

989
01:08:00,277 --> 01:08:04,977
Enjoy an elegant design chosen specifically by myself.

990
01:08:05,677 --> 01:08:09,977
And of course, how could one continue a journey into vast and unforgiving lands

991
01:08:09,977 --> 01:08:11,677
without a source of healing?

992
01:08:11,677 --> 01:08:15,277
Rejuvenate thyself with this generous flask—or rather, glass—

993
01:08:15,277 --> 01:08:18,477
that seems to refill endlessly upon rest at your lantern.

994
01:08:18,477 --> 01:08:20,977
At least, I think it will.

995
01:08:20,977 --> 01:08:23,977
There really are no guarantees in this life, but give it a try yourself,

996
01:08:23,977 --> 01:08:25,477
see if the myths are true.

997
01:08:25,477 --> 01:08:29,277
Enjoy your favorite beverage during a night of exploring your favorite fantasy scenarios.

998
01:08:29,277 --> 01:08:32,477
But naturally, it would do me no good to leave thee without a... I don't know,

999
01:08:32,477 --> 01:08:34,277
bedtime story?

1000
01:08:34,277 --> 01:08:37,477
To put this enchanting collection into context.

1001
01:08:37,477 --> 01:08:42,977
So please enjoy a short audiobook-style recording of a fantastical story written by yours truly.

1002
01:08:42,977 --> 01:08:48,477
Believe it or not, we are the stars of this tale, so enjoy it on a rainy evening wrapped warmly in Death's embrace.

1003
01:08:48,477 --> 01:08:51,477
The... the blanket, I mean.

1004
01:08:51,477 --> 01:08:53,477
You can use the flask,

1005
01:08:53,477 --> 01:08:55,977
also for like drinking at the same time.

1006
01:08:55,977 --> 01:08:58,977
I don't know, just... You should really buy the full set.

1007
01:08:58,977 --> 01:09:03,277
And definitely do, because lucky skeletons who act fast and purchase the entire set

1008
01:09:03,277 --> 01:09:07,277
will be granted a hand-signed postcard with a special color variant

1009
01:09:07,277 --> 01:09:10,977
of Shimhaq's masterpiece rendition of Death herself.

1010
01:09:10,977 --> 01:09:13,977
The hand-signed option is in limited supply, so you must be swift.

1011
01:09:13,977 --> 01:09:17,977
For those that are unable to secure this extremely rare offering in time, do not fret.

1012
01:09:17,977 --> 01:09:21,277
By purchasing the entire set, a duplicated foil-stamped signature postcard

1013
01:09:21,277 --> 01:09:22,477
will be sent as a bonus for your purchase.

1014
01:09:22,477 --> 01:09:26,977
That is all from me, Death's Maiden and dark fantasy enjoyer, Mori Calliope.

1015
01:09:26,977 --> 01:09:30,677
This year's goods are very different from my usual, but I wanted to pay tribute to a genre

1016
01:09:30,677 --> 01:09:31,977
that I love so dearly,

1017
01:09:31,977 --> 01:09:35,477
and has really made every day of my job so wonderful and happy.

1018
01:09:35,477 --> 01:09:38,677
I am so grateful to you guys for coming to enjoy my show as well.

1019
01:09:38,677 --> 01:09:40,477
Comment and let me know what your favorite part was,

1020
01:09:40,477 --> 01:09:43,477
be sure to like the concert so others may be recommended it,

1021
01:09:43,477 --> 01:09:45,477
and subscribe if you enjoy Mori Calliope!

1022
01:09:45,477 --> 01:09:48,277
With that, I bid thee farewell,

1023
01:09:48,277 --> 01:09:52,477
and happy birthday... to me!

1024
01:10:01,708 --> 01:10:03,358
Happy Birthday to me!

1025
01:10:03,358 --> 01:10:05,058
6 birthdays, huh?!

1026
01:10:05,058 --> 01:10:08,058
今回はいつも以上に特別だったな！
This time was even more special than usual!

1027
01:10:08,058 --> 01:10:11,058
ゲストのみんな、Dead Beats、バンドメンバー
To my guests, my Dead Beats, my band,

1028
01:10:11,058 --> 01:10:14,458
そして私が飛ぶのを見たいと思ってくれるみんなへ！
and everyone who wants to see me fly,

1029
01:10:14,458 --> 01:10:16,458
でっかい愛を！
much love to you all!

1030
01:10:16,458 --> 01:10:19,558
もっとハッピーな一年にしようぜ！
Let's have an even happier year!

1031
01:10:19,558 --> 01:10:21,158
一緒にな！
Together!

1032
01:10:21,158 --> 01:10:23,558
Calliope Mori!
- Calliope Mori

